</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 0.25in; margin-top: 0pt; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">As of April 1, 2025, there were&#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c2" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="dei:EntityCommonStockSharesOutstanding" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-2359">135,845,569</ix:nonFraction>&#160;shares
of common stock of the Company issued and outstanding.</p><div>

