    <td>31.3 *</td>
    <td>&#160;</td>
    <td><a href="ea024018001ex31-3_solidion.htm">Certification of Chief Executive Officer pursuant to Section 302 of the Sarbanes-Oxley Act of 2002.</a></td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td>&#160;</td>
    <td>&#160;</td>
    <td>&#160;</td></tr>
